{
    "background_story": "Kenzo was a gentle giant, a majestic Asian elephant with a unique personality. He lived in a sanctuary where he was known for being a nudger - always gently pushing and prodding his caretakers to get attention or to initiate play. Kenzo's favorite game was hide-and-seek among the trees, where he would use his trunk to nudge his friends in the right direction. But Kenzo's nudging wasn't just about play; he also used it to show affection and comfort. Whenever a new elephant arrived at the sanctuary, Kenzo would gently nudge them with his trunk, welcoming them to the herd. His caretakers adored Kenzo's gentle nature and his ability to bring the group together with his subtle yet powerful nudges.",
